00:33:24.360 --> 00:33:25.950
no one I've ever interacted with

00:33:25.950 --> 00:33:27.197
has interacted with stuff
outside the light cone

00:33:27.197 --> 00:33:28.063
and so on and so forth.

00:33:28.063 --> 00:33:29.010
I mean, just by definition,

00:33:29.010 --> 00:33:30.180
that's what a light cone is.

00:33:30.180 --> 00:33:33.000
But the nice thing of a
light cone is not madness,

00:33:33.000 --> 00:33:34.890
it's actually very highly accepted.

00:33:34.890 --> 00:33:38.310
And I think the fact that we understand it

00:33:38.310 --> 00:33:39.420
and that we wonder,

00:33:39.420 --> 00:33:41.040
we wonder at it.

00:33:41.040 --> 00:33:42.120
We wonder at the universe,

00:33:42.120 --> 00:33:43.717
and so on and so forth.

00:33:45.330 --> 00:33:46.900
Well, the second whiskey is

00:33:48.750 --> 00:33:51.750
even with its new fund resources,

