00:34:51.083 --> 00:34:54.645
That's a question I think
that would take thought,

00:34:54.645 --> 00:34:55.545
but that would be,

00:34:57.283 --> 00:34:58.450
that would be,

00:34:59.763 --> 00:35:02.163
that would be worth exploring.

00:35:04.140 --> 00:35:06.300
And then the thing about the features

00:35:06.300 --> 00:35:08.400
and the fact that I introduced this stuff,

00:35:09.870 --> 00:35:12.510
you know, conceptually in a certain sense.

