00:42:29.820 --> 00:42:32.220
and its causal laws and
stuff has to have substance.

00:42:32.220 --> 00:42:34.050
If you generalize the notion of causation

00:42:34.050 --> 00:42:35.370
to be everything that we can,

00:42:35.370 --> 00:42:37.410
that scientists can actually
come up with accounts

00:42:37.410 --> 00:42:38.640
