for 25 cents or even a nickel.

00:43:03.930 --> 00:43:04.763
So,

00:43:07.230 --> 00:43:08.410
so I wanna say that

00:43:10.590 --> 00:43:12.990
reference is not causal,

00:43:12.990 --> 00:43:15.300
but hanging onto a notion of causal

00:43:15.300 --> 00:43:17.310
such that reference isn't it,

00:43:17.310 --> 00:43:20.640
is actually fundamental to
doing justice to science.

00:43:20.640 --> 00:43:23.790
And so I think you generalize
the notion of causation

00:43:23.790 --> 00:43:27.220
at the peril of understanding

00:43:29.310 --> 00:43:32.073
what science is and what constraints it.

